c_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMah0cBA9qE7-zrn-w_DBKD94uaDV29Zp3O4lf8_pO6ag&oe=6AC65B8B"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g27jIhIUkIIQ7kNvwGvvk4s&_nc_oc=AdrW_XfdqnY91YWTzF6s-ukQzRIGS0BAbRn4JfpWdrbiBR4wOnjCF_jQ_ch5tYcEfSY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPqdhgOpBTP1nurNZ7gP59TMrKb264mcA87HTaxSqpIsg&oe=6AC64F09"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BkqeFQFNgeoQ7kNvwGJJwuy&_nc_oc=AdpwONvXbFfFrXGf8yLBKh22bqWxQbLhOIqR5zqqmK2HsrPopt2kKNpG0aG-wBBiB24&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNulbyLUy20z1H-szts9qb9HyJS0y_KGHrNnZlQr-mlcA&oe=6AC64D3D"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.577